  "reflectionText": "Naboth's field, Ahab's house, and Jehu's zeal show how grievously violence spreads through lives and generations. Yahweh's word through Elijah came to pass amid human choices that brought bloodshed and loss. What becomes of zeal when it has no room for mercy?",
